# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COURSE NAVIGATION MENU  (www/menu-courses.jemdoc)
#
# The Courses section includes THIS menu instead of www/menu.jemdoc, so it is a
# site of its own, laid out exactly like the Edge AI Lab (www/menu-lab.jemdoc):
# click Courses on the main site and you land in here.
#
#   * The FIRST line is the site name, and it is the link back to the main site.
#   * A line WITHOUT brackets is a coloured section heading.
#   * A line with brackets is a link:  Visible text [target-file.html]
#
# "Home" is the Courses page, which shows every course; the entries under it are
# the courses themselves. The home entry is called Home, not "All courses", so
# that the sidebar reads the same way the lab's does.
#
# Each course is ONE page holding everything the course needs -- course
# information, slides, textbook and the other files. Nothing is split up and
# nothing has to be bookmarked: this sidebar moves *between* courses, and a
# course page carries all of its own material.
#
# To add a course: add the page in www/, add one line below, and add one card to
# www/courses.jemdoc.
#
# Careful: jemdoc marks the current entry with a SUFFIX test, so one page name
# must never be the tail of another. See guide.md §6.4.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Phuong Luu Vo [index.html]
